: 232, "text": "itself", "start": 89.835, "end": 90.135}, {"i": 233, "text": "this", "start": 90.195, "end": 90.356}, {"i": 234, "text": "morning,", "start": 90.396, "end": 90.736}, {"i": 235, "text": "or", "start": 90.956, "end": 91.036}, {"i": 236, "text": "was", "start": 91.116, "end": 91.256}, {"i": 237, "text": "it", "start": 91.296, "end": 91.356}, {"i": 238, "text": "running", "start": 91.396, "end": 91.636}, {"i": 239, "text": "late", "start": 91.676, "end": 91.876}, {"i": 240, "text": "again?", "start": 91.916, "end": 92.176}, {"i": 241, "text": "Ten", "start": 93.096, "end": 93.256}, {"i": 242, "text": "minutes", "start": 93.296, "end": 93.536}, {"i": 243, "text": "behind.", "start": 93.596, "end": 93.957}, {"i": 244, "text": "I", "start": 94.777, "end": 94.817}, {"i": 245, "text": "had", "start": 94.857, "end": 94.957}, {"i": 246, "text": "assumed", "start": 94.977, "end": 95.297}, {"i": 247, "text": "as", "start": 95.337, "end": 95.397}, {"i": 248, "text": "much", "start": 95.457, "end": 95.657}, {"i": 249, "text": "and", "start": 95.897, "end": 95.997}, {"i": 250, "text": "left", "start": 96.037, "end": 96.257}, {"i": 251, "text": "early.", "start": 96.317, "end": 96.597}, {"i": 252, "text": "A", "start": 97.578, "end": 97.638}, {"i": 253, "text": "wise", "start": 97.678, "end": 98.018}, {"i": 254, "text": "habit.", "start": 98.058, "end": 98.458}, {"i": 255, "text": "Anything", "start": 99.238, "end": 99.598}, {"i": 256, "text": "good", "start": 99.638, "end": 99.858}, {"i": 257, "text": "planned", "start": 99.898, "end": 100.218}, {"i": 258, "text": "for", "start": 100.278, "end": 100.378}, {"i": 259, "text": "the", "start": 100.398, "end": 100.478}, {"i": 260, "text": "holiday?", "start": 100.518, "end": 100.939}, {"i": 261, "text": "Very", "start": 102.039, "end": 102.279}, {"i": 262, "text": "little.", "start": 102.339, "end": 102.579}, {"i": 263, "text": "Deliberately.", "start": 102.999, "end": 103.579}, {"i": 264, "text": "Thank", "start": 104.68, "end": 104.86}, {"i": 265, "text": "you", "start": 104.9, "end": 105.02}, {"i": 266, "text": "again,", "start": 105.06, "end": 105.3}, {"i": 267, "text": "Dr.", "start": 105.36, "end": 105.62}, {"i": 268, "text": "Mogenson.", "start": 105.66, "end": 106.08}], "segments": [{"start": 0.098, "end": 0.438, "text": "Come in."}, {"start": 1.118, "end": 2.279, "text": "I am Dr. Mogenson."}, {"start": 2.839, "end": 4.22, "text": "I do not believe we have met."}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 5.56, "text": "We have not."}, {"start": 6.341, "end": 6.881, "text": "Anders Dahl."}, {"start": 7.982, "end": 8.922, "text": "Thank you for fitting me in."}, {"start": 9.802, "end": 10.303, "text": "Not at all."}, {"start": 10.663, "end": 11.223, "text": "Have a seat."}, {"start": 12.163, "end": 13.504, "text": "What can I help you with today?"}, {"start": 14.404, "end": 16.145, "text": "I would like the influenza vaccination."}, {"start": 16.946, "end": 19.307, "text": "I am hoping to get it done before the season really starts."}, {"start": 20.187, "end": 20.987, "text": "That is sensible."}, {"start": 21.608, "end": 23.068, "text": "Let me take you through it in order."}, {"start": 23.969, "end": 25.349, "text": "First, the side effects."}, {"start": 26.15, "end": 26.61, "text": "Please do."}, {"start": 27.442, "end": 32.445, "text": "I have gone through what you can expect after the injection so you know what is normal and what is not."}, {"start": 33.125, "end": 34.126, "text": "Does that all make sense?"}, {"start": 35.026, "end": 36.047, "text": "It does, yes."}, {"start": 36.887, "end": 37.468, "text": "That is clear."}, {"start": 38.388, "end": 38.668, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 39.549, "end": 44.692, "text": "Second, I want to check there are no acute signs of illness today because that would mean waiting."}, {"start": 45.532, "end": 46.053, "text": "And are there?"}, {"start": 46.973, "end": 47.253, "text": "None."}, {"start": 47.634, "end": 49.415, "text": "You are clear to be vaccinated now."}, {"start": 50.575, "end": 55.418, "text": "While I am here, I would also like the pneumococcal vaccination, if that is appropriate for me."}, {"start": 56.266, "end": 57.846, "text": "You have raised it at the right time."}, {"start": 58.527, "end": 62.328, "text": "So today is a vaccination request and a risk assessment together."}, {"start": 63.088, "end": 63.908, "text": "That was my thinking."}, {"start": 64.788, "end": 66.009, "text": "Are they given at the same visit?"}, {"start": 66.909, "end": 67.409, "text": "Not quite."}, {"start": 68.089, "end": 70.05, "text": "The influenza one I am giving you now."}, {"start": 70.81, "end": 72.531, "text": "That is InfluVac Tetra."}, {"start": 73.351, "end": 74.171, "text": "And the pneumococcal?"}, {"start": 75.131, "end": 79.753, "text": "I am creating a prescription for Previnar 13 and Pneumovax 23."}, {"start": 80.673, "end": 82.474, "text": "Third step, and then you are done."}, {"start": 83.474, "end": 83.954, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 85.014, "end": 86.354, "text": "Thank you for laying it out that way."}, {"start": 87.375, "end": 88.135, "text": "You are welcome."}, {"start": 88.955, "end": 92.176, "text": "Did the bus behave itself this morning, or was it running late again?"}, {"start": 93.096, "end": 93.957, "text": "Ten minutes behind."}, {"start": 94.777, "end": 96.597, "text": "I had assumed as much and left early."}, {"start": 97.578, "end": 98.458, "text": "A wise habit."}, {"start": 99.238, "end": 100.939, "text": "Anything good planned for the holiday?"}, {"start": 102.039, "end": 102.579, "text": "Very little."}, {"start": 102.999, "end": 103.579, "text": "Deliberately."}, {"start": 104.68, "end": 106.08, "text": "Thank you again, Dr. Mogenson."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.023}}